WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:08.190
This is Code Canvas for the web. The Design Lab opens with three studies
in light, color, and space.

2
00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:18.190
Open Coral study and zoom in on the ribbon. Turn on the alignment grid.
Tap the percentage to fit the artwork again.

3
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:25.690
Back in the library, you can import your own file. Here I'm opening a
standalone SVG illustration.

4
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:35.690
Open the top-right menu and choose Source. Edit the title, then choose
Apply and Preview to see the result.

5
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:44.190
The same library and canvas work on a phone. No sign-in is needed.
Imports stay in this browser.

6
00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:54.190
Finally, export the source from the artwork menu to keep a backup. The
web and Android apps have separate links on the project page.
